    "updated_at": "2020-07-08T12:26:05Z",
    "body": "It looks like we invented sandboxed iframes, but gradually, we are turning them into regular iframes.\r\n\r\nI am using regular iframes everywhere and it works great. If you are afraid that the page inside a frame will be \"evil\", don't use it into your page.",
