    "updated_at": "2020-09-03T13:30:00Z",
    "body": "We had some power BI custom visuals, which used to export the visual data in custom format than the default way provided by Microsoft. They were functioning great, but now because of this restriction all of our visuals became useless. As @sanederchik suggested, showing a prompt to the user when a sandboxed iframe downloads a file would be a great idea.",
